Package: reamped
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2
Description: A modern music player built in Rust
 ReAmped is a high-performance music player with support for multiple audio
 formats, metadata caching, MPRIS integration, and low CPU consumption.
 .
 Features:
  - Support for MP3, FLAC, WAV, OGG, AIFF, AC3, MKA, MKV and more
  - Magic-number file detection
  - Metadata caching for faster scanning
  - MPRIS D-Bus integration for multimedia controls
  - Optimized CPU usage (2-3% when playing)
